### S3 Access Points Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/s3
@bucketId = test-bucket

### 1. Create a Bucket (Pre-requisite)
POST {{baseUrl}}/buckets/create-bucket
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "{{bucketId}}",
    "region": "us-east-1"
}

### 2. Create Access Point (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/buckets/{{bucketId}}/access-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "my-access-point",
    "networkOrigin": "internet"
}

### 3. List Access Points (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/buckets/{{bucketId}}/access-points

### 4. Update Access Point Origin (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/buckets/{{bucketId}}/access-points/my-access-point
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "networkOrigin": "vpc"
}

### 5. Verify Update (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/buckets/{{bucketId}}/access-points

### 6. Set Block Public Access (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/buckets/{{bucketId}}/block-public-access
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "blockAll": false
}

### 7. Set Specific Block Public Access (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/buckets/{{bucketId}}/block-public-access
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "blockPublicAcls": true,
    "ignorePublicAcls": true,
    "blockPublicPolicy": false,
    "restrictPublicBuckets": false
}
